show "=== Session contract: template ==="

remember a source called primary-source with "paste the verbatim source text here"
remember a claim called working-claim with "paste the claim text being verified here"

remember a string called source-state with "unscanned"
remember a string called claim-basis with "none"
remember a list called tracked-decisions with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"
remember a number called decision-count with 0

remember how to disclose from status: show status
remember how to summarize from label: count label

when source-state is equal to "unscanned"
  show "HOLD: source not yet scanned — verify before consequential claims"

when claim-basis is equal to "inference" unless source-state is equal to "verified"
  show "WARNING: current claims are inferred, not verified against source"

when claim-basis is equal to "verified"
  show "OK: claims grounded in verified source"

show "--- state snapshot ---"
show source-state
show claim-basis
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions

show "--- example: citing the source before a consequential claim ---"
cite "paste" from primary-source

show "--- example: accumulating decisions and questions ---"
add "decision-architecture-three-layer" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-vocab-bounded-35" to tracked-decisions
add "question-pack-loader-design" to open-questions
show tracked-decisions
show open-questions
summarize from tracked-decisions

show "--- example: routing on verification status ---"
choose if source-state is equal to "verified": show "proceed with claims" otherwise show "hold or disclose"

disclose from claim-basis

show "=== Session contract: Kestrel integration design ==="

remember a source called kestrel-spec with "Project Kestrel API spec v0.4 (frozen 2026-04-12). Version: 0.4.2. Base URL: https://api.kestrel.internal/v0. Auth: bearer JWT, RS256, 15-minute expiry, refresh via /auth/refresh. Rate limits: 240 requests/minute per project token (burst 30/sec). Hard ceiling at 5,000 requests/hour. Returns 429 with Retry-After header (seconds). Payload schema: 17 top-level fields. Required: id (UUID v7), tenant_id, created_at (RFC 3339), event_type. Optional: 13 others. Maximum payload size: 256 KiB. Idempotency: clients SHOULD send Idempotency-Key header (UUID v4). Server retains keys for 24h. Webhooks: outbound POSTs sign HMAC-SHA256 with X-Kestrel-Signature; signing secret rotates every 90 days. Decided 2026-04-12 by the platform team: ship v0 with these limits; revisit rate caps after first 500 customers onboard."

remember a string called source-state with "verified"
remember a string called claim-basis with "verified"
remember a list called tracked-decisions with "none"
remember a list called open-questions with "none"

cite "240 requests/minute" from kestrel-spec
cite "5,000 requests/hour" from kestrel-spec
cite "15-minute expiry" from kestrel-spec
cite "256 KiB" from kestrel-spec
cite "rotates every 90 days" from kestrel-spec
cite "revisit rate caps after first 500 customers" from kestrel-spec

add "question-rate-limiter-strategy" to open-questions
add "question-jwt-refresh-loop" to open-questions
add "question-idempotency-key-storage" to open-questions
add "question-webhook-secret-rotation-handling" to open-questions
add "question-payload-size-enforcement-client-side" to open-questions

add "decision-retry-honor-retry-after-header" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-jitter-50-to-250ms" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-local-budgets-240min-5000hr" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-pace-at-90-percent-ceiling" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-background-cap-4-per-sec" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-idempotency-key-reused-across-retries" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-max-5-attempts-per-operation" to tracked-decisions
add "decision-retry-abort-on-4xx-except-408-429" to tracked-decisions
